#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/layout/cute/index.rst:88
#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/layout/cute/index.rst:71:<autosummary>:1
msgid ""
"Convert a Python value to an FFI :class:`IntTuple` (the inverse of :func:"
"`to_python`): a nested tuple/list becomes an :class:`IntTupleTuple` branch; "
"an int becomes :class:`IntTupleConst`; a PrimExpr becomes :class:"
"`IntTuplePrimExpr`; a :class:`ScaledBasis` becomes :class:"
"`IntTupleScaledBasis`; an already-built :class:`IntTuple` passes through."
msgstr ""

